cline, Filipov said. \par \par \uc2  BNB \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves stood at $525 million at the end of November last year. -- Anastas Petrov, Sofia Newsroom, 359-2-876032 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011003dt1304j8p\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
