\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Bulgaria \highlight\uc2  Lev/BNB  \highlight22\uc2 Intervenes \highlight\uc2  -4: Mineralbank Bonds \b0\par\par\uc2 286 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Mai 1996\par 19:05\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Obretenov said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had failed to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in April, instead increasing interest rates to 108%. And he doubts how long they will be able to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 . 'Their reserves are too thin,' he said. \par \par \uc2  Moreover, the IMF has made it a condition of further lending that Bulgaria maintain its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves, he added. \par \par \uc2  'I think tomorrow (Friday) will be the last day they come in to check rates,' Obretenov said of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . 'For the next month they won't be in and the dollar will go slowly, slowly higher.' \par \par \uc2  The increase in fuel prices, VAT and other measures aimed at raising revenue are certain to push up inflation, traders argued. \par \par \uc2  While international investors are calm at the moment that Bulgaria will continue servicing its foreign debts, investors who bought privately-placed bonds issued in 1989 by the bankrupt Mineralbank are worried they won't be repaid when the 5 billion yen in bonds mature June 14. The state closed Mineralbank May 17. \par \par \uc2  Talk in Sofia, however, is that the bank has sufficient reserves in Swiss francs in a Swiss bank to cover the bonds, and in the event it doesn't, that the government could take the debt on as state debt, a trader said, citing a contact at Mineralbank. \par \par \uc2  And on the domestic side, despite the crushing burden of high rates, National Bank Governor Filipov said it's not possible to cut the base rate, given current exchange rates, according to BTA. The rate can be lowered only in case the tendency is reversed, he added. \par \par \uc2  Overall, said Obretenov, 'the situation is really bad.' \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 30-05-96 \par \par \uc2  1705GMT \par \par \uc2  1199 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds5u04hoa\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
