\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Bulgaria \highlight\uc2  Lev/BNB  \highlight22\uc2 Intervenes \highlight\uc2  -3:  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Reserves Are Thin \b0\par\par\uc2 268 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Mai 1996\par 19:04\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also moved to limit the amount of minimum reserves commercial banks could withdraw. \par \par \uc2  'This is a complex of measures to stabilize the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, given that demand considerably exceeds supply,' National Bank Governor Lyubomir Filipov told parliament Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was small by world standards, perhaps, but dealers pointed out that the Bulgarian market, is small, under developed, and easily moved by what in more mature markets would be small amounts. 'The problem with our market is that it's small and not liquid,' the Postbank dealer said. \par \par \uc2  And volatile. 'We started at 170, went to 210 then came to 150,' Obretenov said. 'Normal people are nervous,' he said. Customers who bought dollars at 200 to 210 leva are now asking 'how can we cancel the deal,' he added. \par \par \uc2  The outlook for the lev remains far from rosy. The one result of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  seems to be that the lev won't fall as rapidly against the dollar as it has in recent weeks. But it seems certain it will continued to depreciate. 'Nobody wants to sell dollars. Everybody wants to buy dollars,' Obretenov said. \par \par \uc2  While the market is calm now, how long that - and the lev's recovery against the dollar - will last 'depends on the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' said the Postbank dealer. 'If not too many buyers appear, the market could go to 150' leva per dollar he said, adding he doesn't expect it to climb again to 200 leva per dollar. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 30-05-96 \par \par \uc2  1704GMT \par \par \uc2  1199 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds5u04ho7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
