\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Bulgaria \highlight\uc2  Lev/BNB  \highlight22\uc2 Intervenes \highlight\uc2  -2: Mkt Doubted It Would Act \b0\par\par\uc2 248 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Mai 1996\par 19:04\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  The Bulgarian lev has suffered badly in the current economic crisis, slipping to 161.97 leva per dollar from 70.704 leva per dollar at the end of 1995. The lev recovered at Thursday's fixing, whose rate is used for statistical and reference purposes, rising to 147.04 leva per dollar. \par \par \uc2  After signing a memorandum of intent with the International Monetary Fund (IMF), the Bulgarian government Wednesday and Thursday announced a series of price increases for energy, higher value-added taxes (VAT) and a 5% import duty to compliment efforts to close loss-making enterprises and insolvent banks. \par \par \uc2  The country's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves fell to $670 at the end of April from more than $1.2 billion at the end of 1995 as the country made payments on some $1.2 billion of foreign debt servicing due this year. \par \par \uc2  As reserves fell, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  refrained from \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the lev. Thus market participants were surprised when the BNB stepped into the market Wednesday and again Thursday. \par \par \uc2  'I don't think the market believed they would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' said the trader at the Bulgarian Postbank. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governing board Wednesday decided to stop funding commercial banks, limiting the inflow of leva that they might use to purchase hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also raised rates on security repurchase agreements, the state news agency BTA reported. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 30-05-96 \par \par \uc2  1704GMT \par \par \uc2  1199 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds5u04ho4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
