\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Bulgaria \highlight\uc2  Lev Around 140 Leva/Dlr After BNB  \highlight22\uc2 Intervenes \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2  By George Bayliss \par \uc2 254 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Mai 1996\par 19:04\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  PRAGUE (AP-Dow Jones)--The Bulgarian lev settled around 140 leva per dollar Thursday after two days of heavy \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bulgarian National Bank (BNB), dealers in Sofia said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  took the market by surprise Wednesday, when the dollar was offered as high as 210 leva on Bulgaria's thin and nervous \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The Bulgarian National Bank spent some $7 million to $10 million of its precious - and dwindling - \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves Wednesday and another $3 million to $5 million Thursday in \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the market, estimates Lyubomir Obretenov, chief dealer at First East International Bank in Sofia. \par \par \uc2  The 'Continent' newspaper quoted Stoyan Shoukerov, head of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  department, as saying that when the dollar reached 190 to 195 leva, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold $4 to $4.5 million. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said Wednesday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  knocked the dollar down to 150 to 155 leva. \par \par \uc2  Thursday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold dollars at 150 leva, 145 leva and 140 leva, with the dollar finally settling at 135 to 140 leva at the close of trading Thursday. \par \par \uc2  A dealer at the Bulgarian Postbank said he expects the lev Friday at near the same level, quoting a spread of 130 to 140 leva per dollar. \par \par \uc2  'I think 135-140 (leva per dollar) is the low,' said Obretenov, adding, '140 is a very, very good level to buy.' \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 30-05-96 \par \par \uc2  1704GMT \par \par \uc2  1199 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds5u04ho1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
