\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Bulgaria \highlight\uc2  c-bank to support lev with  \highlight22\uc2 interventions \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 272 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Mai 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SOFIA, May 29 (Reuter) - The Bulgarian National Bank (BNB) said in a statement on Wednesday it would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the local interbank \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to support the lev. \par \par \uc2  "The BNB board decided to launch unlimited \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  from May 29 on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in support of the national \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said the statement, released after an extraordinary board meeting. \par \par \uc2  Direct dollar sales launched by the BNB at noon on Wednesday helped the lev recover to 140-145 by mid-afternoon from historic lows of 200 per dollar in early morning bids for foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Several Bulgarian commercial banks joined the BNB's dollar sales during the afternoon, offering dollars on sale orders by final clients eager to sell while the dollar was expensive. \par \par \uc2  The lev closed at 150-160 per dollar after the BNB halted its dollar offers. \par \par \uc2  Many dealers expressed doubts about the BNB's power to prop up the lev with \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  alone because of its severely limited \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves. \par \par \uc2  BNB governor Lyubomir Filipov said on Tuesday that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would have to curb its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the domestic interbank market in line with pledges made to the International Monetary Fund (IMF). \par \par \uc2  The Fund has asked Bulgaria to boost its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves under a preliminary funding deal agreed on Monday. \par \par \uc2  BNB \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves have fallen to around $500 million according to unofficial estimates. Bulgaria faces foreign debt payments of some $700 million in July alone. \par \par \uc2  Filipov did not say how the BNB planned to raise its \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves. \par \par \uc2  -- Gareth Jones, Sofia Newsroom, 359-2-328101 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011018ds5t07ecv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
